    "detailed_description": "Welcome to G.R.E.G. - The Generally Really Easy Game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nG.R.E.G. is a precision platformer with over 50 levels that go from easy to very difficult, can you beat them all?<br />\r\nUpdates are planned as the game is not finished yet so expect more to come!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCurrent roadmap:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStep 1 - add sound effects and volume sliders<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStep 2 - add other 4 challenger levels<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStep 3 - add &quot;cosmetics&quot; tied to achievements<br />\r\n<br />\r\n(possible) Step 4 - level editor, importer and exporter",
